  "note": "Two departures. The Weather Report Suite is one 17:08 track on Dave's Picks Volume 2 and three stripes here, split by ear by Jason, 2026-08-17: 1:20 / 4:20 / 11:28. And Seastones is absent from the release altogether — the article says so, \"the complete July 31, 1974 concert, except for 'Seastones'\" — so it takes 21:30 from gd1974-07-31.sbd.miller.32353.sbeok.flac16 and sits where it was played, after Let It Grow. The Ned Lagin and Phil Lesh piece ran between sets, which is why the release could leave it out and still call itself complete."
